  "body": "Summer’s coming. Your never-ending holiday is calling.\r\n\r\nSignificant investment has transformed this exceptionally peaceful, hidden and private 4 –\r\nbedroom hideaway, including a renewed exterior, an additional bedroom, new ensuite,\r\ndouble-glazed joinery and a large solar-heated pool.\r\n\r\nAn expansive, sheltered deck captures the sun from morning to dusk, with a louvred roof for shade and a ceiling heater for cooler evenings. The kitchen, living and deck connect beautifully, creating a natural hub for relaxed family living and entertaining, with the pool always in view. Swim, barbecue, linger over long lunches – relaxed, all-weather living has never looked so good.\r\n\r\nImmaculate and much loved, this has been a cherished family home for over 30 years.Generous open-plan living provides room to spread out, while the downstairs living can be separated when children are sleeping upstairs. An oversized landing creates a fabulous second lounge and retreat for kids and teenagers.\r\n\r\nThe primary bedroom enjoys its own private deck and ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms are served by a beautifully updated family bathroom. A third bathroom with bath is conveniently positioned downstairs near the internal-access double garage.\r\n\r\n• 2 living areas, 4 double bedrooms, 3 bathrooms\r\n• Double internal-access garage + generous off-street parking\r\n• Room for a boat\r\n• Completely hidden + private, no shared driveway\r\n• Huge storage cupboard for linen, suitcases, toys + more\r\n\r\nYou won’t appreciate the magic from the road – that’s part of the appeal. Follow the drive and\r\nprepare to be wowed by this peaceful private sanctuary. Whether you’re a family seeking\r\nspace, a downsizer wanting something special, or simply ready for a holiday-at-home\r\nlifestyle, this is your invitation to live gloriously, poolside and close to the beach.\r\n\r\nA short stroll from the beach and vibrant St Heliers Bay village, with Glendowie College and\r\nChurchill Park Primary zoning. Be in for summer.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
